'''The Battle Cats Training Week''' (にゃんこ強化週間, ''Nyanko Kyōka Shūkan'', '''Cat Reinforcement Week''') is an event that is held at random times in [[The Battle Cats]]. This event features [[Treasure Festival]]s, exclusive sales, the XP Festival and unique [[Daily Bonus|Login Stamps]].

==Event Information==
TONS of event to strengthen your Cats! {{Color|#FF9900|'''The Battle Cats Training Week'''}} on now!<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''On from August 3rd (11:00am) until August 28th (10:59am)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF9900|'''● XP Festival Events!'''}}<br>
Get ready to power up your Cats to the max with the special stages Blitz XP, XP Megablitz, XP Colosseum, and Merciless XP at Legend Stages!

{{Color|#00CCFF|'''･ Blitz XP Schedule'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''Mon / Wed / Fri ・・・ 7:00pm ~ 9:59pm'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''Tues / Thurs ・・・ 11:00am ~ 1:59pm'''}}<br>
{{Color|#00CCFF|'''･ XP Megablitz Schedule'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''Mon / Wed / Fri / Sun ・・・ 11:00am ~ 1:59pm'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''Tues / Thurs / Sat ・・・ 7:00pm ~ 9:59pm'''}}<br>
{{Color|#00CCFF|'''･ XP Colosseum Schedule'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''Mon / Thurs・・・ 4:00pm ~ 4:59pm'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''Tues / Fri / Sun ・・・ 10:00pm ~ 10:59pm'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''Wed / Sat ・・・ 8:00am ~ 8:59am'''}}<br>
{{Color|#00CCFF|'''･ Merciless XP Schedule'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''Mon ・・・ 10:00pm ~ 11:59pm'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''Wed ・・・ 4:00pm ~ 5:59pm'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''Fri ・・・ 8:00am ~ 9:59am'''}}<br>
{{Color|#00CCFF|'''･ XP Bonanza Schedule'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''Tues ・・・ 8:00am ~ 9:59am'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''Thurs ・・・ 10:00pm ~ 11:59pm'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''Fri ・・・ 4:00pm ~ 5:59pm'''}}<br>
Don't miss out on this chance!

※ Regularly occurring XP events will also be be available outside of the times listed above.<br>
※ XP Megablitz is available after Empire of Cats Ch. 3 is cleared. XP Colosseum becomes available after Into the Future Ch. 1 is cleared. Merciless XP will be available after Into the Future Ch. 3 is cleared and User Rank 1600 reached. XP Bonanza will be available after Unleashing Cats is cleared.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''● Duel Stages now available!'''}}<br>
Put your honor on the line! Your strongest fighter versus one opponent in single combat!<br>
Are you ready for the Duel Stages?<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''On from January 16th (11:00am) until January 23rd (10:59am)!'''}}

Visit the Special Stages section of the Legend Stages to challenge the Duel Stage.<br>
In any duel stage, you will only be able to deploy one Cat at a time against the single powerful enemy who appears! Think carefully before you choose who'll defend the honor of your Cat Army!<br>
A new fight will appear each day, so keep an eye out for the next challenger!<br>
Steel your resolve and get ready to face down your opponent!

※ If Duel Stages do not appear, make sure that your Battle Cats app is updated to the most recent version available.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''●Tag Arena Event!'''}}<br>
Seek out the summit of a massive challenge with your strongest partner in the Tag Arena.<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''On from January 23rd (11:00am) until January 30th (10:59am)!'''}}<br>
Visit Event Stages/Legend Stages from the title menu and look for {{Color|#0000FF|'''Tag Arena'''}} on the map list to challenge this limited-time event!

Tag Arena stages are special stages that are challenged in a 2 vs. 2 format! Different tactics will be necessary to complete these stages!

Duos with the best combination stand the best chance, so think carefully before sending them out into battle!

※If the event does not appear, please update to the latest version of The Battle Cats.<br>
Only during this event, you can send your Gamatoto adventurer to the limited areas Cats Eye Cave and XP Harvest  for a special set of Cats Eye rewards!<br>
Get as many Cats Eyes as you can and help your units break through to even higher levels!

{{Color|#46BDC6|'''・XP Harvest (3 areas)'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''On from January 16th (11:00am) until January 23rd (10:59am)!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#46BDC6|'''・Cats Eye Cave'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''On from January 23rd (11:00am) until January 30th (10:59am)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Catfruit / Catseye Limited Item Capsule Events!'''}}<br>
At the Capsule Menu, tap the buttons at top left to switch between standard Capsule events and the {{Color|#FF0000|'''Catseye Limited Capsules'''}} & {{Color|#FF0000|'''Catfruit Limited Capsules'''}}!<br>
Power up your Cats! Don't miss out on these cool items!

{{Color|#46BDC6|'''・Catseye Item Capsules'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''On from January 16th (11:00am) until January 23rd (10:59am)!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#46BDC6|'''・Catfruit Item Capsules'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''On from January 23rd (11:00am) until January 30th (10:59am)!'''}}

※The Catfruit Limited Capsules provide Catfruit and XP rewards, while Catseye Limited Capsules will provide Catseyes and XP!<br>
※Catfruit Limited Capsules will appear after Empire of Cats Ch. 3 is completed in The Battle Cats, and Catseye Limited Capsules will appear in the Cat Capsules once User Rank 1600 is cleared.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''●Cat Food rewards every day!'''}}<br>
Limited-time log-in stamps on now!<br>
Log in during this limited-time event to earn up to {{Color|#FF0000|'''280 Cat Food'''}} every day! Don't forget to grab your free items!

※There are 14 stamps available during this event.<br>
※Update to the latest version of The Battle Cats to access the log-in stamps.

